Source: satori-config
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Maintainer: satori project <noreply@satori.invalid>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: satori-config
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, curl, gpgv, nftables, libpam-gnome-keyring, libpam-runtime
Description: satori desktop defaults and helper scripts
 System-wide defaults for the satori desktop: the X session
 (satori-session), herbstluftwm autostart and keybindings, polybar and picom
 configuration, and startx on tty1. Defaults live in /usr/share/satori and
 are used only when the user has no configuration of their own.
 .
 Security and privacy defaults: an nftables firewall (satori-firewall),
 Firefox ESR and Brave telemetry policies, and Wi-Fi scan MAC randomisation.
 .
 Helper scripts: satori-run-once, satori-keys, satori-powermenu,
 satori-screenshot, and satori-get-melia (downloads, verifies and installs
 the proprietary Melia email client on request).
